  "dcterms:title": "Lab technician",
  "dcterms:description": "A person who performs clinical tests on specimens of bodily fluids and tissues in order to get information about the health of a patient, as well as conducts tests and operates equipment for analysis of biological material, including blood and urine. This person normally has completed formal training in biomedical science, medical technology or a related field.",
